# Score B: notes copied from the Italian Wikipedia page at its URL, under CC BY-SA 4.0; the page is the attribution. Retrieved 2026-11-07, used only to compare, never served.
# Verse 1 with its chorus echoes, then the solo refrain up to "la!"; the chorus repeat of the refrain is left out.
# The print has the English words by Edward Oxenford; the melody is Denza's, "included by arrangement with G. Ricordi".
id funiculi-funicula
de Funiculì, Funiculà
en Funiculì, Funiculà
aliases funiculi;jamme jamme
tempo 120
bar 12
pickup 2
